    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 48,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "V2 staging only. CloudWatch metrics can arrive late. Missing/error is not zero. ALB target health is not ECS desired/running count. HTTP 200 polling does not prove trip completion. Logs below use CloudWatch Logs Insights; refresh only when needed (query charges). App saturation, queue and completion metrics are added in later tasks. Grafana access remains through SSM."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "FE logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "staging-cloudwatch"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "${region}",
          "expression": "fields @timestamp, @message, @logStream | sort @timestamp desc | limit 100",
          "logGroupNames": [
            "${frontend_log}"
          ],
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "name": "${frontend_log}",
              "arn": "${frontend_log_arn}",
              "accountId": "${account_id}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "BE logs",
      "datasource": {
